# Exporting to a Markdown buffer
Output docs/media/export-md.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-export-md; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/export.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>oe export dispatcher` Enter
Show
Type " oe"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "m"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "M"
Sleep 2s
Sleep 1.5s
